  m_text: 'Grab the Ball: Use the Grip Button with the Ray Interactor to pick up
    a bowling ball from the rack.

    Throwing Rule:

    When the light is green,
    you can throw the ball.

    When the light is red, throwing is blocked.

    Scoring
    System:

    Standard 10-frame bowling rules apply.

    Knock down all pins
    on the first throw for a Strike.

    Knock them all down in two throws for a
    Spare.

    Objective: Aim for the highest score possible!'
